"""The Vet's boss card portrait: row strings at card resolution (1 key = 1 card pixel). Full-body three-quarter lunge
toward the left (the player), aiming the syringe pistol with a drop on the needle and a glint star, a scalpel raised in
the other hand, menacing grin behind glinting round glasses, stethoscope swinging, coat tails flaring back.
Pasted at ORIGIN on the transparent 427x240 card by cards.boss_card.

The whole figure is enclosed by its own outline and touches no card edge on purpose: the game sizes the card to the UI
screen height (BossCardUIController.RecalculateScales), and on the 3440x1440 test machine that puts the card's bottom
and right edges in mid-screen, so any art cut at a card edge shows as a hard straight line (the 0.11.0 card's flat
rectangle). A silhouette that closes on itself reads right at every resolution, like the vanilla Beholster card.

Ramps: coat W / 0 / , with a > rim (the syringe glow); scrubs < / $ / ~ / t; skin 8 / = / - / ;; hair % / # / @;
steel & / % / #; vaccine K / > / * / /; glass k / n; outline o (2 px on the silhouette, 1 px between parts)."""
